The top recommendation is the Philips Sonicare DiamondClean Smart 9500 because it offers comprehensive features such as app-guided feedback, multiple brush heads, and visible whitening in just 3 days. The Waterpik Sonic-Fusion 2.0 follows closely as it combines brushing and water flossing in one tool, offering efficient all-in-one care.

The BURST Pro Sonic Toothbrush, Colgate hum smart toothbrush, Sonic-FX Solo, and Oral-B Pro 1000 are all strong contenders, each offering unique features such as 3D cleaning action, personalized brushing guidance via app, sonic vibrations, and dentist-recommendations. The FOREO ISSA mikro is a good choice for parents looking for a toothbrush for their babies, while the Quip electric toothbrush is suitable for minimalists seeking form, function, and simplicity.
